{"date": "2019-10-03", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2019/1003.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:32:56+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "baa9420d83b9ac34c8b9a38aee7715329de89632f4abdb446c791272e847dc1c", "image_bytes": 115143, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 30 Sep 2019 10:37:34 GMT", "title": "宜浮生若梦", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "那些花儿", "author": "朴树", "author_roles": ["歌手"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "有些故事还没讲完那就算了吧，那些心情在岁月中已经难辨真假，如今这里荒草丛生没有了鲜花，好在曾经拥有你们的春秋和冬夏。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5}
{"date": "2019-10-04", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2019/1004.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:32:56+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "54bafef33c2b101b25078cb691b398724ea02f62efd602c49da708bb26e877b4", "image_bytes": 93017, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 30 Sep 2019 10:37:35 GMT", "title": "宜吸猫", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "村上春树·猫", "author": "铃村和成", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "三只猫、一个暖炉、一杯水、一本书，时光在淅沥的雨声中慢下来。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5}
